{"id":"40010752104d30b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing4 Quotient Forcing Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition — ZFC Forcing4 Quotient Forcing Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition — ZFC Forcing4 Quotient Forcing Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition — ZFC Forcing4 Quotient Forcing Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"accc6d580eff4d8a\" href=\"?note=accc6d580eff4d8a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q},G,q\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q},G,q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"accc6d580eff4d8a\" href=\"?note=accc6d580eff4d8a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4QuotientForcingCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4QuotientForcingCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4QuotientForcingCondition}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q},G,q)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land q\\in\\mathbb Q\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4QuotientForcingCondition}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q},G,q)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land q\\in\\mathbb Q\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Since the complete-suborder predicate embeds <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>, compatibility between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> and every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is evaluated in the correct ambient order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md","status":"resolved","id":"accc6d580eff4d8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md","status":"resolved","id":"accc6d580eff4d8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q},G,q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4QuotientForcingCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4QuotientForcingCondition}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q},G,q)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land q\\in\\mathbb Q\\land\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2096","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition.md|58-df-zfc-forcing4-quotient-forcing-condition]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["accc6d580eff4d8a","1331244a5201bb99"]}